; Automated transactions whose must-balance postings keep every
; transaction balanced (src/xact.cc, auto_xact_t::extend_xact, and
; xact_base_t::verify).  Since #3317 each balancing group is verified
; on its own, so a rule's postings must balance within the groups
; their accounts put them in: the rule below books the budget pair in
; the bracket-virtual group and the savings entry inside the real
; group's own balance, which the elided posting completes.

= /^Expenses:Food/
    [Budget:Food]    -1
    [Budget:Savings]  1

= /^Expenses:Books/
    (Budget:Books)    -1

= /^Expenses:Snacks/
    Assets:Savings    0.0001

= /^Expenses:Energy/
    Assets:Rebate    1
    Income:Rebate   -72.00 EUR

2026/01/01 lunch
    Expenses:Food    10.00 USD
    Assets:Cash

2026/01/02 novel
    Expenses:Books    20.00 USD
    Assets:Cash

2026/01/03 crisps
    Expenses:Snacks    10.00 USD
    Assets:Cash

2026/01/04 power
    Expenses:Energy    100 kWh @@ 72.00 EUR
    Assets:Cash

test bal
          -72.00 EUR
          -40.00 USD
             100 kWh  Assets
          -72.00 EUR
          -40.00 USD    Cash
             100 kWh    Rebate
          -20.00 USD  Budget
          -20.00 USD    Books
          -10.00 USD    Food
           10.00 USD    Savings
           40.00 USD
             100 kWh  Expenses
           20.00 USD    Books
             100 kWh    Energy
           10.00 USD    Food
           10.00 USD    Snacks
          -72.00 EUR  Income:Rebate
--------------------
         -144.00 EUR
          -20.00 USD
             200 kWh
end test
